SUMMARY:AYPROS October Pub Club: Pack's Tavern & Underground Tunnel Tours
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\n# **AYPROS October Pub
  Club: Pack's Tavern & Underground Tunnel Tours**\n\n![](https://aypros.wi
 ldapricot.org/resources/Pictures/Pub%20Club%20Designs%20(Instagram%20Post%
 20(4_5))%20(1).png)**This month's Pub Club is going underground!**\n\nJoin
  AYPROS on **Tuesday\, October 27**\, for a Halloween-week Pub Club at **P
 ack's Tavern** in downtown Asheville\, complete with an opportunity to exp
 lore the historic underground tunnels beneath the building.\n\nWe'll gathe
 r in Pack's **Century Room on the Park** for an evening of drinks\, conver
 sation\, and a little Asheville history. With its historic setting and und
 erground passageways\, Pack's offers a fun twist on our usual Pub Club\, j
 ust in time for Halloween.\n\nWhether this is your first AYPROS event or y
 ou know half the room already\, Pub Club is meant to be easy. Leave the bu
 siness cards at home. There's no presentation\, no agenda\, and no expecta
 tion that you have to work the room. Grab a drink\, catch up with some fam
 iliar faces\, and introduce yourself to somebody new.\n\nWe'll be there fr
 om **5:00 PM - 8:00 PM**\, and\, as always\, Pub Club is come-and-go. Show
  up when you can and stay as long as you'd like.\n\nYour **first drink is 
 on us**\, courtesy of our Pub Club Title Sponsor\, **Allen Stahl + Kilbour
 ne (ASK Law)**\, while drink tickets are available.\nPack's will have beer
 \, wine\, cider\, and seltzer options available\, along with additional dr
 inks for purchase. A limited food menu will also be available for anyone l
 ooking to grab a bite.\n\nAnd since it's Halloween week\, **costumes are w
 elcome but totally optional!** Come dressed up if you're feeling festive\,
  or just come as you are.\n\n## What to Expect\n\n* A relaxed\, come-and-g
 o evening at Pack's Tavern in downtown Asheville\n* Your first drink inclu
 ded courtesy of ASK Law\, while drink tickets last\n* Small-group tours of
  Pack's underground tunnels\, subject to availability\n* Additional bevera
 ges\, including cocktails\, available for purchase\n* A limited food menu 
 available for purchase\n* A chance to explore a little of Asheville's hist
 ory\n* Plenty of time to catch up with friends and meet other young profes
 sionals\n* First-time attendees and people coming on their own are absolut
 ely welcome\n* No formal networking program or speeches\n* Optional Hallow
 een costumes for anyone feeling festive\n\n## Schedule\n\n**5:00 PM** \\- 
 Check\\-in opens\\\, first drinks\\\, and Pub Club begins\n**Around 5:30 P
 M** \\- Underground tunnel tours begin in small groups\\\, with announceme
 nts throughout the evening\n**8:00 PM** \\- AYPROS Pub Club concludes\n*Pl
 ease note: Tunnel tours will be led by Pack's Tavern staff in groups of ap
 proximately five people at a time. Participation is subject to availabilit
 y\, and tours may not be possible for every attendee.*\n\n## Location\n\n*
 *Pack's Tavern**\nCentury Room on the Park\n20 South Spruce Street\nAshevi
 lle\, NC 28801\n\n## Parking\n\nPack's Tavern is located in downtown Ashev
 ille. Downtown parking garages and metered street parking are available ne
 arby. Please allow extra time to find parking.\nCome when you can\, grab y
 our first drink\, and spend a fall evening connecting with Asheville's you
 ng professional community. And if you're feeling adventurous\, you might e
 ven get to see what's hiding beneath Pack's Tavern!\n\nA special thank you
  to **Pack's Tavern** for welcoming AYPROS and coordinating the undergroun
 d tunnel tours\, and to **Allen Stahl + Kilbourne (ASK Law)** for continui
 ng to make Pub Club possible by picking up everyone's first drink.\n\n**We
 'll see you at Pack's!**
