SUMMARY:AYPROS Wortham Social: Champagne & Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\nBottomless champagne\,
  good company\, and a sold-out comedy show? Not a bad way to spend a Frida
 y night!\nJoin AYPROS on **Friday\, October 30**\, as we return to the Wor
 tham Center for the Performing Arts for another evening with our friends a
 t Wortham. We'll start with a come-as-you-are (leave your business cards a
 t home) social featuring **bottomless champagne\, beer\, wine\, and non-al
 coholic beverages**\, followed by a night of stand-up comedy featuring BET
  comedian Shaun Jones.\nIf you've joined us for one of our previous Wortha
 m socials\, you already know these evenings are something special. It's a 
 chance to catch up with familiar faces\, meet other young professionals fr
 om across Asheville\, enjoy a few drinks\, and experience one of our city'
 s great performing arts venues together. Whether you're a longtime AYPROS 
 member or coming to your first event\, you're welcome to join us.\n\n### T
 he Comedy Zone: Shaun Jones\n\nAt 8:00 PM\, we'll head into the Tina McGui
 re Theatre for **The Comedy Zone featuring Shaun Jones**\, a breakout come
 dian known for BET's *Comic View* and Starz's *1st Amendment Stand-Up*.\nS
 haun has entertained audiences around the world\, appeared in *Partners in
  Crime: The Next Generation*\, and shared the screen with Jamie Foxx and S
 ylvester Stallone in *Shade*. Known for his quick wit\, hilarious storytel
 ling\, and larger-than-life personality\, Shaun is bringing the laughs to 
 downtown Asheville for one seriously entertaining Friday night.\n\n### Imp
 ortant Ticket Information\n\n**Both Friday and Saturday's Comedy Zone perf
 ormances are SOLD OUT to the general public!** Fortunately\, our friends a
 t Wortham have reserved a limited number of tickets specifically for AYPRO
 S attendees.\n**A ticket purchase from the Wortham is REQUIRED to attend t
 he comedy performance.** Registering for the AYPROS social does not includ
 e admission to the show. *Also\, you do not have to go to the comedy show 
 to attend the social.*\n**[Purchase your Comedy Zone tickets through Worth
 am](https://www.worthamarts.org/events/the-comedy-zone-shaun-jones/)**\nIf
  you experience any difficulty purchasing tickets online\, call the Wortha
 m Box Office at **(828) 257-4530** and let them know you're attending with
  AYPROS. They'll help you access our reserved tickets.\nTrust us\, this on
 e is worth every penny.\n\n### Event Details\n\n**Friday\, October 30\, 20
 26**\n**6:00 PM - 7:50 PM:** AYPROS Champagne Social\n**8:00 PM:** The Com
 edy Zone featuring Shaun Jones\n**Wortham Center for the Performing Arts**
 \n18 Biltmore Avenue\nAsheville\, NC 28801\n\n### What to Expect\n\n* A re
 laxed evening with Asheville's young professional community\n* Bottomless 
 champagne\, with beer\, wine\, and non-alcoholic options included during t
 he AYPROS social\n* A chance to meet new people and catch up with friends 
 before the show\n* A live comedy performance featuring Shaun Jones (ticket
  required)\n* No formal program\, business cards\, or expectations. Just c
 ome enjoy yourself!\n\n**Please note:** The comedy performance is for ages
  18 and older. Alcoholic beverages are available only to guests 21 and old
 er.\nWe're grateful to our friends at the Wortham Center for continuing to
  create opportunities for AYPROS members to experience the performing arts
  right here in Asheville.\n**Come for the champagne\, stay for the laughs\
 , and spend your Friday night with us!**\nWarm regards\,\n**AYPROS Leaders
 hip Team**
